   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 1.4,
   "text": "5.5 GB. A QUARTER IS VIDEO.",
   "y": -420,
   "fontSize": 56
  },
  {
   "text": "This demo is five and a\nhalf gigabytes, and a\nquarter of that is video\nfiles.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 4.8,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Four of them are two\nhundred and eighteen\nmegabytes each.",
   "start": 5.05,
   "duration": 3.18,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "It's Another Eden Begins,\na JRPG from Wright Flyer,\nwith Chrono Trigger's\nwriter and composer on it.",
   "start": 12.48,
   "duration": 6.576,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Now the build. Unity, and\ntwelve thousand six\nhundred asset bundles,\nevery filename a hash.",
   "start": 19.306,
   "duration": 6.393,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "And xlua.dll. They\nembedded Lua so content\ncan be patched without an\napp store review. Steam\ndoesn't have one.",
   "start": 25.949,
   "duration": 7.83,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Sentry for crashes,\nCRIWARE for audio and\nvideo, R3 for reactive C#.\nA modern stack, straight\noff mobile.",
   "start": 34.029,
   "duration": 8.196,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  }
